WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,390
Others can leave

2
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:03,920
Teacher Xu, what's the matter?

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,440
I want to ask you some questions

4
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:06,960
But it might be a little offensive

5
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:10,320
If you don't want to answer, you can refuse to ask.

6
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,660
Then I'll get right to the point.

7
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:16,780
Do you have any special training methods for regaining weight?

8
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:20,220
Are you willing to share your training methods? Of course

9
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:21,740
The school will definitely give you

10
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:22,700
generous compensation

11
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:24,580
Sorry, Teacher Xu

12
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:26,100
It’s not that I don’t want to share

13
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:27,300
But my method

14
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,540
It is not universal and cannot be used by others.

15
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:34,560
It's related to your pre-sale talent, I understand.

16
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:38,400
I remember you have FG talent, right? It’s common sense.

17
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:39,840
The growth rate of FG is extremely weak

18
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:40,960
But Li Mo’s talent

19
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,720
It can actually bring about such terrifying growth

20
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:47,440
This is completely against the common sense of pre-sale. OK, I understand, you can go back.

21
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:48,480
But don't be complacent

22
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:51,520
You still can’t relax in training. I understand. Goodbye, teacher.

23
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:58,500
Three months old

24
00:00:58,660 --> 00:01:00,260
Not only can you get started, but you can always defy the odds.

25
00:01:00,580 --> 00:01:02,740
Regarding the situation of Li Mo, I must immediately

26
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:03,700
Reported to the principal
